      "x": 117,
      "y": 436,
      "width": 386,
      "height": 98,
      "text": "THE OLD MINDSET  —  \"AI-native\"\n\nGoal: an agent that does not re-crawl or hallucinate.\nDeliverable: a compact, human-verified ai/ map.\nWin condition: the agent edits the right module and\nrespects what is frozen.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-21",
      "originalText": "THE OLD MINDSET  —  \"AI-native\"\n\nGoal: an agent that does not re-crawl or hallucinate.\nDeliverable: a compact, human-verified ai/ map.\nWin condition: the agent edits the right module and\nrespects what is frozen.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12
    },
