      "height": 114,
      "text": "THE NEW MINDSET  —  \"spec + loop\"\n\nGoal: every unit of work is spec-first and reviewed.\nDeliverable: durable artifacts per change (spec, ADR,\nreview, eval, WORKLOG row).\nWin condition: the loop stays honest — reproduce before\nfix, review in fresh context, ledger cannot rot.",
